{"id":"the-prime-enchanter","slug":"the-prime-enchanter","name":"首席附魔师","english":"The Prime Enchanter","kind":"enemy","categoryKey":"bosses","dbKind":"reference","image":"./images/database/renders-thumb-the-prime-enchanter.png","description":"","parameters":[["基础生命","1,500"],["基础伤害","35"],["韧性","700"],["灵魂","200"],["最高单次伤害","35"],["速度","700"]],"tables":[{"title":"Where you fight it","columns":["WHEN","QUEST","WHERE"],"rows":[["Story quest","翻越冰封高地","冰封高地"],["Rematch","复活的首席附魔师","冰封高地"]]},{"title":"Moves","columns":["移动","效果","基础伤害","类型"],"rows":[["Forward strike","His right fist charges with frost for about a 秒ond before he lunges into a punch that knocks you back、leaves you Frozen. The lunge scatters up to 15 ice mines along the ground it covers、so dodge sideways instead of staying in his wake.","25","冰霜"],["Fury fist","Two quick jabs、a pause while both fists power up、then an ice punch (Frozen)、a lightning punch (Zapped)、a two-handed ground slam that applies both. Zapped greatly cuts your damage resistance right before that final slam、so use the power-up pause to roll out of range.","30",""],["Launch","Put distance between you、he launches away、untargetable、invulnerable for about a 秒ond、then comes down on a marked spot by you、up to once every 6 秒onds. The landing point locks in a 秒ond before impact、so keep moving、step clear of the marker、then deal with the ring of ice mines that follows.","25","闪电"],["Ice mines","Eight mines appear in a ring around his Launch landings、and Forward strike scatters more along its path. Each bursts 2 秒onds after it appears for 冰霜 damage、冰冻、with a weaker splash reaching a little further、so keep clear of them until they pop.","8","冰霜"],["Summon illagers","Once he's lost a sliver of health、and at most every 40 秒onds after、he spends about two 秒onds calling in four to eight Pillagers、Vindicators、Royal Guards near one of the arena's platforms、never more than 10 alive at once. Each one is worth 20 souls more than usual.","",""],["闪电 slam","Available from two-thirds health: he charges both fists、jumps、and slams down after about two、a half 秒onds、blasting a wide circle with heavy knockback、Zapped. Get well clear during the windup、since the slam also sends out a lightning ripple、and three of the arena's platforms rise shortly after it lands.","35","闪电"],["闪电 ripple","A ring of lightning spreads out from the slam point across most of the arena、hits each target once. Jump over it or roll through it.","15","闪电"],["Overcharge","Below half health、闪电 slam flows straight into Overcharge: he turns invulnerable、the arena floor carries current for 5 秒onds、hurting you for as long as you stand on it. Don't spend cooldowns on him while it runs、and move the moment it ends、because he launches straight at you、ice mines、all.","5","闪电"]]},{"title":"弱点与抗性","columns":["属性","变化"],"rows":[["闪电伤害","-50%"],["远程伤害","-20%"]]},{"title":"原生属性（定义值）","native":true,"note":"解包表中的直接定义值；继承、难度与战力缩放另行计算。","columns":["定义","参数","数值"],"rows":[["首席附魔师","生命","1500"],["首席附魔师","移动速度","700"],["首席附魔师","韧性","700"],["首席附魔师","韧性恢复延迟","2"],["首席附魔师","韧性恢复速度","2"],["首席附魔师","击退抗性倍率","0.3"],["首席附魔师","远程伤害抗性倍率","0.8"],["首席附魔师","火焰伤害抗性倍率","1"],["首席附魔师","毒素伤害抗性倍率","1"],["首席附魔师","闪电伤害抗性倍率","0.5"],["首席附魔师","冰霜伤害倍率","0.5"],["首席附魔师","最小距离容差修正","50"],["首席附魔师","最大距离容差修正","50"]]},{"title":"原生能力参数","native":true,"note":"保留能力的定义值与覆盖操作；未翻译的内部字段保留原名。","columns":["定义","能力","参数","数值","操作"],"rows":[["首席附魔师","LightningSlam","最大目标距离","400","定义值"],["首席附魔师","LightningSlam","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["首席附魔师","LightningSlam","触发权重","100","定义值"],["首席附魔师","LightningSlam","冷却时间","9.5","定义值"],["首席附魔师","LightningSlam","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["首席附魔师","FuryFist","最大目标距离","150","定义值"],["首席附魔师","FuryFist","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["首席附魔师","FuryFist","触发权重","100","定义值"],["首席附魔师","FuryFist","冷却时间","3.5","定义值"],["首席附魔师","FuryFist","激活期间允许再次触发","否","定义值"],["首席附魔师","ForwardStrike","最大目标距离","250","定义值"],["首席附魔师","ForwardStrike","最小目标距离","0","定义值"],["首席附魔师","ForwardStrike","触发权重","100","定义值"],["首席附魔师","Forw